{"id":"word:hebrew:H8492","type":"word","title":"תִּירוֹשׁ","subtitle":"H8492 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"must or fresh grape-juice (as just squeezed out); by implication (rarely) fermented wine","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תִּירוֹשׁ (H8492) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 38 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תִּירוֹשׁ (tîyrôwsh) means must or fresh grape-juice (as just squeezed out); by implication (rarely) fermented wine First listed occurrence: 2Chr 31 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תִּירוֹשׁ","transliteration":"tîyrôwsh","pronunciation":"tee-roshe'","strong":"H8492","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8492","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/תִּיר֣וֹשׁ","וְ/תִיר֖וֹשׁ","תִּיר֣וֹשׁ","וְ/תִֽירֹשְׁ/ךָ֣","תִּֽירֹשְׁ/ךָ֣"],"morphs":[["HC/Ncmsa",12],["HNcmsa",8],["HTd/Ncmsa",6],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",3],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",2],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp1cs",1],["HNcmsc/Sp2fs",1],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",1],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3mp",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"must or fresh grape-juice (as just squeezed out); by implication (rarely) fermented wine","usage":"(new, sweet) wine.","full":"H8492. tirosh תִּירוֺשׁ noun masculine Judg 9:13 must, fresh or new wine ; **on meaning, see ARSK Ency. Bib. WINE (iv. 5307 f.) . — absolute תִּירוֺשׁ Num 18:12 24 t.; תִּירשׁ Gen 27:28 3 t.; suffix תִּירוֺשִׁי Judg 9:13 ; Hosea 2:11 ; תִּירשְׁךָ Deut 7:13 4 t. Deuteronomy; תִּירוֺשֵׁךְ Isa 62:8 ; תִּירוֺשָׁם Psa 4:8 ; &#8212; must, new wine , as enlivening ׳ת וַאֲנָשִׁים אֱלֹהִים הַמְּשַׂמֵּחַ Judg 9:13 ; as injurious וְת וְיַיִן ׳זְנוּת יִקַּחלֵֿב Hosea 4:11 ; in poetry regarded as contained in the grapes ׳הַתּ בָּאֶשְׁכּוֺל יִמָּצֵא Isa 65:8 , compare 24:7 (|| גֶּפֶן ); as yielding wine ( יַיִן ), וְת שֶׁמֶן תָסוּךְ וְלֹא זַיִת ׳תִּדְרֹךְ יָ֑יִן תִּשְׁתֶּה וְלֹא Micah 6:15 ; usually as a sign of fertility, or as valuable product: ׳וְת יִפְדֹ֑צוּ יְקָבֶיךָ Prov 3:10 with must thy vats shall burst open ; + דָּגָן (q. v.) Gen 27:28 , 37 (both J) Hosea 2:11 ; 7:14 ; Zech 9:17 ; Psa 4:8 ; Isa 62:8 ; ׳ת Hosea 9:2 (|| יֶקֶב גֹּרֶן, compare דָּגָן 9:1 ); ד ׳אֶרֶץ ׳וְת Deut 33:28 ; + יִצְהָר Joel 2:24 ; Neh 10:38 (+ כָלעֵֿץ מְּרִי ); + דָּגָן and יִצְהָר Hosea 2:10 ; Hosea 3:24; Deut 7:13 ; 11:14 ; 12:17 ; 14:23 ; 18:4 ; 28:51 ; Jer 31:12 ; Hag 1:11 ; Joel 1:10 ; 2:19 ; 2Chr 32:28 ; Neh 5:11 ; Nehemiah 10:40; 13:5 , 12 ; ת ׳חֵלֶב Num 18:12 (see ׳ח ; + id. ); ׳ת 2Chr 31:5 + יצהר דגן, , and דְּבַשׁ ; וְת דָּגָן ׳אֶרֶץ וּכְרָמִים לֶחֶם אֶרֶץ Isa 36:17 = 2Kin 18:32 ( + ודבשׁ יצהר זית ארץ ).","rootNote":"or תִּירֹשׁ ; from 3423 in the sense of expulsion;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 31 5","keyReferences":["2Chr 31 5","2Chr 32 28","2Kgs 18 32","Deut 7 13","Deut 11 14","Deut 12 17","Deut 14 23","Deut 18 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":38,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 31 5","book":"2Chr","chapter":31,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּיר֤וֹשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 28","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תִיר֣וֹשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 18 32","book":"2Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תִיר֜וֹשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 7 13","book":"Deut","chapter":7,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תִֽירֹשְׁ/ךָ֣","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 11 14","book":"Deut","chapter":11,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תִֽירֹשְׁ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 12 17","book":"Deut","chapter":12,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/תִֽירֹשְׁ/ךָ֣","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 14 23","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"verse":23,"englis